{"parse": {"title": "WPK-06", "pageid": 59796, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/WPK-05\" title=\"WPK-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">WPK-06</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">WPK</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.A1.AC.E5.B8.81.E3.80.81.E6.B0.94.E7.90.83.E4.B8.8E.E9.A3.98.E5.B8.A6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"硬币、气球与飘带\">硬币、气球与飘带</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 硬币、气球与飘带</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Coins, Balloons, and Ribbons</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>知<span class=\"color-value\"></span>道<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>许<span class=\"color-value\"></span>多<span class=\"color-value\"></span>东<span class=\"color-value\"></span>西<span class=\"color-value\"></span>并<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>能<span class=\"color-value\"></span>通<span class=\"color-value\"></span>过<span class=\"color-value\"></span>许<span class=\"color-value\"></span>愿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>获<span class=\"color-value\"></span>得<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191406</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hubian_huanghun\"><img alt=\"hubian_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>洋葱头的栏目并没有走向完结。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>万幸的是，湖边的水位同样许久不曾涨起了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-301011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-301011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-301011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>大家再坚持一下，马上就到了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一叶小舟载着许多人悠悠地漂向湖中央。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/HeadIconSmall-300911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/HeadIconSmall-300911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/HeadIconSmall-300911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>X先生，你的X-301号似乎下沉得越来越厉害了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-301011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-301011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-301011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>别担心，苏芙比小姐，本船使用的是特制海绵，能够汲取的水量远超普通海绵，当我们沉入水底时，它理应已经汲取了至少85%的泉水了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>至少我们不会因此淹死。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>但愿这一过程不会太久，今天距离下班时间只剩一小时十五分钟了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>让我们一起祈祷吧～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>船只仍在漂荡着，漫天的海浪似乎再也盖不住那娇小的身影了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>同样出现在视野之中的，还有另外两个活泼的人影。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hubian_huanghun\"><img alt=\"hubian_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一如故事开始时最理想的图景。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">气球派对：</div><div>我一直在想新的派对策划案，不停地想！但怎么想都——觉得缺了点什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">气球派对：</div><div>现在我明白了，是浪花派对！你是我见过最好的水花派对策划师，最棒的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她牵起拉拉泉的手，郑重地将一枚气球交到了对方的手上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-303001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-303001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-303001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>我、我吗……？我是最好的……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">气球派对：</div><div>你愿意来帮助我们完善派对吗？我是说，我们需要更多的糖果和彩带，还有气球！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">气球派对：</div><div>噢——当然还有浪花！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-301601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-301601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-301601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">婴儿蓝：</div><div>我们可以把那位“恶龙”先生变得再小一些，这样它也能戴上花环了～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>你、你们愿意……让我也一同加入吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>拉拉泉小姐——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远处的海绵船终于抵达了目的地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>更准确的说法是，那漫漫的湖水早已不知何时悄然消退了不少。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一行人将拉拉泉围在当中。对她而言，这是相当罕见的待遇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>啊——你们是来找我许愿的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>实际上，我们是来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雾行者递出了他精心起草的联名抗议书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉拉泉看也没看，郑重地向他们摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>对不住啦，现在我可没时间帮助你们了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>我接受了婴儿蓝与气球派对小姐的邀请，我们将会举办一场有史以来最精彩、最盛大的——水上派对！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>故事的发展总是出人意料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>当然，如果你们也希望能够参加派对的话……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她又开始冥思苦想了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>唔……这当然也不能算是什么不劳而获的愿望，我可以答应你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X轻松地笑了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这么说，为了那场史无前例的水上派对，你“不得不”将所有因愿望而消耗的泉水都收回陶罐？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>当然——！难道你们打算一直不劳而获吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年幼的孩子紧抱陶罐，警惕地看着笑容越发古怪的对方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>哇！请让我也加入你们——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">气球派对：</div><div>当然可以，苏芙比小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>四只飘扬的气球手挽着手轻快地跑开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>显然，她们需要为更重要的事而忙碌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而其他的朋友们怔在原地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>皆大欢喜，不是么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>……看起来，我能够准时下班了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>但我必须声明，我们仍然需要尽快建立灾难时期的应急预案与停工补偿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雾行者撑开雨伞，赶在上班时间的末尾清除余下的水雾，而热情的记者女士又开始记录了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>看来你也收获了不错的素材，洋葱头女士，恭喜你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他不着痕迹地缓缓后退。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>当然——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>我计划再展示一期最精彩的主角专访与分析！嗯……目前的素材已经制作完成了，只是欠缺了一些最后的剪辑工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>我肯定，不会有观众愿意错过这一部分的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她兴奋地摆弄着一旁的摄影器材，丝毫没有注意到越来越远的白色身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老旧的播放器缓缓倒带。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“咔嗒——”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>女士们，先生们。打起您的精神，现在为您播出的正是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>《泉水精灵特辑》之“走近主角”篇！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>坦白说，这一段素材的来源仅仅是一个意外。而也许更令人意外的是，我决定将它作为故事的结局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>请相信，这并非我个人的心血来潮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>嘘……让我们放轻声些～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不远处的湖畔边，气球派对、婴儿蓝与洋葱头席地而坐。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-senlin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"senlin\"><img alt=\"senlin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/600px-Cg-senlin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/900px-Cg-senlin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/1200px-Cg-senlin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>闪着红灯的镜头倾倒在草丛边，歪歪斜斜的青草露出了掩藏在其中的身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>抱着陶罐的孩子反复做着同一个动作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>我、我是泉水精灵……拉拉泉！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>很高兴……认、认识你们！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>相信我，我能帮你们实现愿望！很多很多的愿望——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>……如果你们愿意与我成为朋友的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“咔嗒——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最后一丝水汽也被收入伞中。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0xiangzinei\"><img alt=\"0xiangzinei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/600px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/900px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/1200px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0xiangzineihuanghun\"><img alt=\"0xiangzineihuanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png/600px-Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png/900px-Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png/1200px-Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>新一刻的钟声缓缓敲响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>呼……精灵的心情真是比伦敦当局的政策还要变幻莫测……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>……向她许愿的我又何尝不是天真的选民呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>我们能依靠的只有自己，以及身边的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他无奈地摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>啊，雾行者先生，很高兴你还没有离开，我正在构思一期新的专访，很希望能邀请你来参加！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>……我下班了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就这样，洪水退去了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0xiangzineihuanghun\"><img alt=\"0xiangzineihuanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png/600px-Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png/900px-Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png/1200px-Cg-0xiangzineihuanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">约翰·提托：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到最后，约翰·提托都不曾理解她的愿望带来了怎样的后果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她只是戴上耳罩，沉浸在16进制的世界里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>好消息是，在那场史上最大的水上派对到来前，她都可以一直这样沉浸下去。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "WPK-06"}}